-   $$ \mathbf{e}_t = t $$
-   
-   *Sinusoidal Form (Variant):*
-   $$ \mathbf{e}_t = [\sin(2^0 \pi t), \cos(2^0 \pi t), \dots, \sin(2^{L-1} \pi t), \cos(2^{L-1} \pi t)] $$
